    <string name="help_title">Supported firmware</string>
    <string name="help_text">• Android 2.3 and 4.0–4.4: main support; 5.x–6.x: experimental.\n• 32-bit ARM firmware only (armeabi / armeabi-v7a).\n\nFormats:\n• CWM/TWRP recovery ZIP (MIUI, CyanogenMod, ports, most custom ROMs);\n• Samsung: Odin .tar / .tar.md5 or a ZIP with AP_*.tar.md5;\n• Google factory images (.tgz / .zip);\n• system.img (ext4, sparse), TWRP backup system.ext4.win;\n• OTA with system.new.dat(.br) + system.transfer.list.\n\nBest if the archive contains boot.img: the service start order is taken from it.</string>
